---
name: venv-discipline
severity: error
on:
  - edit
where:
  - "**/*.py"
  - "scripts/**"
  - "ci/**"
then:
  - run: |
      make -s venv.check || { echo "::error ::Python must run from .venv. Run 'make venv.ensure' and retry."; exit 1; }
    message: "All Python must execute from .venv (guard enforced)."
---
Ensure Cursor/terminal sessions are bound to `${workspaceFolder}/.venv`.
This rule fails-fast on edits that would execute Python outside the venv.